青いまま過ぎる前になって願ってた
I was wishing before it passed while still blue.

147
00:41:43,064 --> 00:41:48,064
飲み切れなかった日々も 炭酸のせいなら
Even the days I couldn't swallow down, if it's because of the fizz,

148
00:41:48,264 --> 00:41:52,064
これもアクセントって思えた
I could think of it as just a bit of flair.

149
00:41:53,064 --> 00:41:59,064
チラッと見えてた雲も本当は 少しにごっていて
Even the cloud I caught a glimpse of was actually a little hazy,

150
00:42:00,064 --> 00:42:05,064
雨降りのように思い出すんだ
and I recall it like a downpour.

151
00:42:07,564 --> 00:42:12,064
みんなの青春、今日ここで今ねねでいっぱいにしていってください！
Fill up your youth with Nene right here, right now!

152
00:42:13,864 --> 00:42:18,864
大人になればなるほど僕ら 心が動くことも減るのかな
The older we grow, does our heart get moved less and less?

153
00:42:19,064 --> 00:42:22,564
後戻りなんてできやしないから まっすぐ
Since there's no turning back, straight ahead...

154
00:42:23,564 --> 00:42:28,564
僕のドキドキにつられて踊らされて朝起きちゃうような
getting carried away by my pounding heart, dancing and waking up in the morning...

155
00:42:29,064 --> 00:42:32,564
そんな日々にふっと
to days like that, suddenly...

156
00:42:33,264 --> 00:42:38,564
ずっとカラカラのままでいた 僕の音はまだ止まらない
I was completely parched all along, but my sound still won't stop!

157
00:42:39,864 --> 00:42:44,864
イライラくらいパンパンパン はじけさせ 高鳴るほうへ
Pop all that frustration away—pop, pop, pop—towards where excitement swells!

158
00:42:45,564 --> 00:42:49,064
モヤモヤも全部吹き飛ばせ
Blow away all that haze too!

159
00:42:49,864 --> 00:42:53,064
君の思うまま描いていけ
Draw things out just as you wish!

160
00:42:53,264 --> 00:42:58,564
ずっと夜に咲く大輪の花のように 僕ら
Like huge flowers blooming in the night, we...

161
00:42:58,864 --> 00:43:04,064
眩しさを持って咲かせたいの
want to bloom with dazzling brightness!

162
00:43:04,564 --> 00:43:08,564
あてのない言葉が
Aisles of aimless words...

163
00:43:08,864 --> 00:43:12,564
体を追い越すの きっとそれくらいでいいの
overtake my body, and I'm sure that's just fine!

164
00:43:12,864 --> 00:43:15,564
今は何もかも脱ぎ捨てて
For now, cast everything off...

165
00:43:16,864 --> 00:43:19,064
さあ行こう！
Let's go!

166
00:43:41,864 --> 00:43:45,864
というわけで始まりました！
And with that, it has officially begun!

167
00:43:45,864 --> 00:43:52,064
桃鈴ねね 1st Live「ねねねねねねねね☆超愉快！」
Momosuzu Nene 1st Live: 'Nenenenenenenene Super Joyful!'

168
00:43:58,564 --> 00:44:01,564
じゃあまず、ねねの自己紹介をさせていただきたいと思います！
First off, I'd like to do my self-introduction!

169
00:44:01,864 --> 00:44:05,564
ねねが「みんなの心のー」って言ったら、みんな何て返すんだっけ？
When Nene says 'Everyone's heart's...', what do you all reply with again?

170
00:44:07,264 --> 00:44:09,064
その通り！よくできました！
That's right! Very well done!

171
00:44:09,264 --> 00:44:14,264
じゃあ行くよ！ホロライブねぽらぼのねね！みんなの心のー？
Alright, here we go! Hololive Nepolabo's Nene! Everyone's heart's...?

172
00:44:17,564 --> 00:44:20,064
こと、桃鈴ねねでーす！
...wife, Momosuzu Nene here!

173
00:44:24,864 --> 00:44:29,064
もう、待ちに待ちに待ちに待った 1st Live！
Man, the long, long, long-awaited 1st Live!

174
00:44:29,264 --> 00:44:38,264
今回のテーマは、「楽しさ最大出力」をテーマに！ねねがみんなと一緒に超愉快化していくっていうライブにしていきたいと思ってまーす！
With this time's theme being 'Maximum Fun Output', I want to make this a live concert where Nene and everyone become super joyful together!

175
00:44:40,864 --> 00:44:42,264
いいね、いいねー！
Nice, nice!

176
00:44:42,564 --> 00:44:52,564
普通のライブと違って、みんなが参加してめちゃくちゃ楽しめるようにね、いっぱいワクワクとかドキドキを持って来たから、みんな楽しみにしててね！
Unlike regular concerts, I brought tons of excitement and thrills so everyone can participate and have a blast, so look forward to it!

177
00:44:54,864 --> 00:44:59,864
そして、ねねの 1st Album『Peachful Story』みんな聴いてくれたー？
And has everyone listened to Nene's 1st Album 'Peachful Story'?

178
00:45:02,872 --> 00:45:06,072
いいね！もうなんかタオルがちょっと汗ばんでる人がいるくない？
Nice! Aren't there already people whose towels are a bit sweaty?

179
00:45:07,272 --> 00:45:10,872
みんなー！どの曲が好きだったー？せーの！
Everyone! Which song did you like? Ready, set...

180
00:45:13,372 --> 00:45:17,872
おー、うんうん... ちょっと待って、そっちの人、何が好き？
Oh, I see, I see... Wait a sec, people over there, which one did you like?

181
00:45:18,872 --> 00:45:20,572
全部！？全部？こっちの人ー？
All of them!? All of them? How about people over here?

182
00:45:22,872 --> 00:45:27,072
全部！全部か！ねねも全部好きでーす！
All of them! All of them, huh! Nene likes all of them too!

183
00:45:28,272 --> 00:45:30,272
ありがとう！そして今回は...
Thank you! And this time...

184
00:45:30,372 --> 00:45:35,872
ガールズバンドの生演奏でお届けしていきます！ご紹介させてください！
We're bringing this to you with live music by an all-girls band! Please let me introduce them!

185
00:45:36,772 --> 00:45:40,872
キーボードでバンドマスターの、シエリホさん！
On keyboards and bandmaster, Shieriho-san!

186
00:45:45,372 --> 00:45:49,272
そしてギターの、新妻リオンさん！
And on guitar, Niizuma Rion-san!

187
00:45:51,272 --> 00:45:52,272
カッコイイ！
So cool!

188
00:45:52,372 --> 00:45:55,872
そしてベースの、AIMI VADERさん！
And on bass, AIMI VADER-san!

189
00:45:56,872 --> 00:45:58,872
渋くていいね！
So tastefully cool!

190
00:45:59,272 --> 00:46:02,272
ドラムの、坂田菜々子さんでーす！
On drums, Sakata Nanako-san!

191
00:46:06,072 --> 00:46:13,272
はい、そしてちょっとね、配信の方にも触れていきたいと思うんですけど、みんなコメントいっぱいありがとー！
Alright, and next I'd like to talk about the stream too. Everyone, thank you so much for all the comments!

192
00:46:14,072 --> 00:46:17,872
この辺にね、配信の人が見ているカメラがあるの！
Right around here, there's a camera that the streaming viewers are looking through!

193
00:46:18,072 --> 00:46:20,572
イエーイ！
Yay!

194
00:46:20,872 --> 00:46:24,072
みんなありがとー！いっぱいスクショ撮ってねー！
Thank you everyone! Take lots of screenshots, okay!

195
00:46:25,072 --> 00:46:29,072
そして今回のライブの感想とかはね、全部ハッシュタグ...
And for your thoughts on today's live stream, please put them all under the hashtag...

196
00:46:29,172 --> 00:46:30,872
もも... あ、違うな。
Momo... Ah, wait, no.

197
00:46:31,572 --> 00:46:37,072
ハッシュタグ #ねね超開花 でたくさんポストしてくださいー！
Post lots using the hashtag #ねね超開花!

198
00:46:38,872 --> 00:46:45,072
そして今YouTube、そしてTikTokでご覧の方は、次の曲まで聴けるので...
And for those watching on YouTube and TikTok right now, you can listen up to the next song...

199
00:46:46,072 --> 00:46:54,572
まだまだ一緒に盛り上がりたいなーって人は、概要欄から配信サイトへGO!してくださいー！
So if you want to keep pumping up with us, please head to the streaming site from the description section!

200
00:46:56,072 --> 00:47:00,872
さあみんな、始まる前からギラファねね唱してたけど...
Now everyone, even before we started you were chanting Giraffa Nene, but...

201
00:47:01,072 --> 00:47:04,272
まだまだライブ始まってたった2曲だからね！
The live concert has only just started with two songs!

202
00:47:04,572 --> 00:47:07,572
さっそく次の曲に行こうかなー！
So shall we move right into the next song?!

203
00:47:08,872 --> 00:47:11,872
次は少ししっとりめの曲から聴いてください。
Next, please listen to a slightly more mellow song.

204
00:47:40,872 --> 00:47:44,272
凍えているかな
Is it freezing, I wonder?

205
00:47:44,372 --> 00:47:48,072
桜色に染まった
Dyed in sakura colors,

206
00:47:48,872 --> 00:47:52,572
帰り道の途中
On the way back home,

207
00:47:53,072 --> 00:47:56,872
流れていく春の風吹
The flowing spring flurry of petals.

208
00:47:57,072 --> 00:48:00,072
隣を歩いて
Walking beside you,

209
00:48:00,172 --> 00:48:04,272
少し背伸びしていた
I stretched myself just a little taller.

210
00:48:05,072 --> 00:48:09,572
変わらない距離も
Even this unchanging distance,

211
00:48:09,872 --> 00:48:13,872
本当は縮めたくて
Truth is, I wanted to close it,

212
00:48:14,072 --> 00:48:18,072
言えなくて
Unable to say it,

213
00:48:18,172 --> 00:48:22,072
言わなくて
Without saying it,

214
00:48:22,172 --> 00:48:25,872
「またね」じゃ足りないよ
"See you later" isn't enough.

215
00:48:26,072 --> 00:48:29,872
いつかまた会えるかな
I wonder if we'll meet again someday.

216
00:48:30,072 --> 00:48:36,572
君と何回だって 何回だって 笑い合えた春の日
No matter how many times with you, those spring days we laughed together...

217
00:48:37,072 --> 00:48:41,572
風に舞って消えた
Fluttered in the wind and vanished.

218
00:48:42,072 --> 00:48:45,072
それでも忘れない
Even so, I won't forget.

219
00:48:45,172 --> 00:48:50,572
ほどけた手と手 離れていく
Hands unclasped, drifting apart,

220
00:48:51,072 --> 00:48:55,072
言葉を形にしていた
Giving shape to our words,

221
00:48:55,172 --> 00:48:58,572
甘く触れて溶けた思い
Feelings touched sweetly and melted.

222
00:48:59,072 --> 00:49:02,572
それでも忘れない
Even so, I won't forget.

223
00:49:02,872 --> 00:49:05,872
サヨナラじゃなくて
Not a goodbye,

224
00:49:06,072 --> 00:49:09,572
ありがとう
But a thank you.

225
00:49:15,572 --> 00:49:19,072
言葉を抱いて
Holding these words close,

226
00:49:19,272 --> 00:49:23,072
胸の奥にしまった
Tucked deep inside my heart,

227
00:49:23,272 --> 00:49:26,872
あどけない気持ち
These innocent feelings,

228
00:49:27,072 --> 00:49:30,572
本当は伝えたくて
Truth is, I wanted to tell you,

229
00:49:30,872 --> 00:49:34,572
届けたい...
Wanting to reach you...

230
00:49:34,872 --> 00:49:37,872
届かない...
Unable to reach...

231
00:49:38,072 --> 00:49:42,272
「またね」じゃ足りないけど
Though "See you later" isn't enough,

232
00:49:42,572 --> 00:49:46,572
いつかまた会えるかな
I wonder if we can meet again someday.

233
00:49:46,872 --> 00:49:53,572
君と何回だって 何回だって 見上げた空の色も
No matter how many times with you, even the color of the sky we looked up at...

234
00:49:54,072 --> 00:49:59,072
風に乗って ひらり舞った
Rode the wind and fluttered softly.

235
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:03,080
かなしみも 思い出も
Sadness, memories,

236
00:50:03,080 --> 00:50:08,580
これから描く 未来地図
and the map of the future we'll draw from here on out,

237
00:50:08,580 --> 00:50:12,780
魔法みたいに 染めて
color them as if by magic.

238
00:50:12,780 --> 00:50:16,880
きっと どこにも 居場所がない
Even if tomorrow comes where I feel

239
00:50:16,880 --> 00:50:20,580
明日だとしても
like I don't belong anywhere...

240
00:50:20,580 --> 00:50:24,880
昨日も 今も 褪せない記憶
Memories from yesterday and now that never fade,

241
00:50:24,880 --> 00:50:28,280
写真みたいに 色付いて
taking color like a photograph...

242
00:50:28,280 --> 00:50:33,280
ずっと ぬくもりを 覚えていた
I always remembered that warmth.

243
00:50:33,280 --> 00:50:37,080
春の匂いがした
It smelled like spring.

244
00:50:38,080 --> 00:50:43,080
君と 何回だって 何回だって
Time and time again with you,

245
00:50:43,080 --> 00:50:47,080
笑い合えた春の日
on those spring days when we laughed together...

246
00:50:47,080 --> 00:50:51,280
風に舞って ふわり 消えた
Dancing in the wind, softly fading away,

247
00:50:51,280 --> 00:50:55,580
それでも 忘れない
but even so, I won't forget.

248
00:50:55,580 --> 00:51:00,080
ほどけた手を 繋ごうとして 離れてく
Trying to hold unraveled hands, only to drift apart,

249
00:51:00,080 --> 00:51:04,580
言葉を探していた
I was searching for the right words.

250
00:51:04,580 --> 00:51:08,880
甘く 触れて 溶けた 思い
Sentiments that melted with a sweet touch,

251
00:51:08,880 --> 00:51:12,080
それでも 忘れない
but even so, I won't forget.

252
00:51:12,080 --> 00:51:15,080
サヨナラじゃなくて
Not a "goodbye,"

253
00:51:15,080 --> 00:51:19,280
ありがとう
but "thank you."

254
00:51:31,580 --> 00:51:36,580
生まれてきたドキドキを響かせていこう
Let's resonate the excitement that was born!

255
00:55:00,088 --> 00:57:00,088
無料パートは終了いたしました。 ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The free part of the stream has ended. Thank you for watching!

